---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How MaaxGen collects, uses, and protects information, including analytics and advertising cookies.">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero--accent">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        This policy explains what information MaaxGen collects on maaxgen.com, how we use it, and the
        choices you have. Review with counsel as your business requirements change.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose legal-copy">
      <h2>Information we may collect</h2>
      <p>
        MaaxGen may collect information submitted through contact forms, booking forms, email, or other inquiry channels. This may include name, email address, business name, website, phone number, and message details.
      </p>
      <p>
        When you allow analytics or advertising cookies, we and our partners may also collect device and usage data such as pages viewed, approximate location derived from IP address, browser type, and interactions with ads or site content.
      </p>

      <h2>How we may use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to inquiries and schedule calls</li>
        <li>Understand the services a prospect may need</li>
        <li>Improve website content, offers, and communication</li>
        <li>Measure site performance and advertising effectiveness when you consent</li>
        <li>Maintain basic business records and follow-up notes</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>SMS and mobile communications</h2>
      <p>
        If you provide your phone number and opt in through our contact form, MaaxGen may send text messages related to the consent you select (marketing updates and/or non-marketing messages such as appointment confirmations, replies to your inquiry, and account or service updates). Consent to receive text messages is optional and is never a condition of submitting a form or contacting us. Message frequency may vary, and message and data rates may apply. You can reply STOP at any time to opt out, or HELP for assistance.
      </p>
      <p>
        No mobile information will be shared with third parties/affiliates for marketing/promotional purposes. Information sharing to subcontractors in support services, such as customer service is permitted. All other use case categories exclude text messaging originator opt-in data and consent; this information will not be shared with any third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics and advertising cookies</h2>
      <p>
        MaaxGen uses optional analytics and advertising technologies only after you make an affirmative choice in our cookie banner (Accept all, Reject all, or Save preferences). Essential cookies needed for basic site function do not require that choice.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Tag Manager (GTM-MF279RR2)</strong> — loads and manages tags on the site when analytics consent is granted.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Analytics 4 (G-W5R65NR85B)</strong> — measures traffic and on-site behavior when analytics consent is granted. Deployed through Google Tag Manager.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Meta Pixel (1528990838912009)</strong> — measures visits and conversion events for Meta advertising when advertising consent is granted.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You can change or withdraw cookie preferences anytime with the “Cookie preferences” control in the site footer. Rejecting analytics or advertising cookies does not prevent you from using the site or submitting the contact form.
      </p>

      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>
        MaaxGen uses third-party tools for forms, booking, analytics, advertising measurement, CRM, email, and website hosting. Current analytics and advertising tools are listed above. Other vendors may process inquiry data to respond to your request.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Accept, reject, or customize analytics and advertising cookies via the banner or footer link</li>
        <li>Opt in or out of SMS marketing and transactional texts on the contact form</li>
        <li>Use browser controls to block cookies generally (some site features may be limited)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:support@maaxgen.com">support@maaxgen.com</a>. Confirm the preferred privacy contact email and business mailing address with counsel if needed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
